  "description": "Construction of a single storey rear extension and the construction of a single storey rear outbuilding",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div&gt;The scale, siting and design of the proposed single storey rear extension would result in unacceptable loss of daylight, overshadowing,&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;sense of enclosure and overbearing impacts&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;impacts to neighbouring properties&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;no.7 Eastbury Square and no.2 Mayesbrook Road.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;Therefore, the proposal would constitute unneighbourly development which is contrary to:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December 2024);&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;- Policy D6 of the London Plan (March 2021);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;- Policies DMD1, DMD5 and DMSI3 of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan 2037 (September 2024); and&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 14.98px;&quot;&gt;- The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
